  specialEffectName: DOUBLE JEOPARDY
  desc_tactics: "Executioner, slow and tanky on the frontline, he punishes his Marked
    enemy with relentless damage. He is most effective against enemies in the front.
    Hook In let him pull enemies into his range and Mark them. Hitting a Marked enemy
    while his signature Double Jeopardy is active will not consume the Mark.  Executioner
    ignores enemy Armor with Sharpen Blade. His Brutal Swing does extra damage against
    Marked targets. Combo Brutal Swing with Cleave Legs\u2019 Critical Exposed to
    deal devastating damage to Marked enemies. He can even Bone Break his enemy if
    he can manage to apply Body Compromised from Guilty Verdict before it. "
  desc_about: 'Executioner About Executioner About Executioner About Executioner
    About Executioner About '
